26. Optimistic Update

Implement a complete optimistic update.

Flow:

User clicks update
 ↓
cancelQueries
 ↓
get previous cache
 ↓
update cache immediately
 ↓
API request
 ↓
SUCCESS → keep changes
ERROR → rollback
SETTLED → refetch

Use:

onMutate
onError
onSettled

Store the previous data and rollback if API fails.

Provide complete TypeScript code.

